# CONTROL for `todo/t0841` (R48 Track D1) — GREEN BEFORE AND AFTER.
#
# This is the statement-loop spelling of
# `cow_comprehension_invariant_owned_name.gg`: same invariant owned name, same
# heap-forced payload, same number of pushes into the same collection type. It
# was already correct at pre-fix HEAD (run rc 0, `ababab`, ASan-clean, on C and
# `--backend=llvm`) because `Stmt::For` carried the two-pass back-edge dance the
# comprehension arms lacked.
#
# ⚠ IT IS THE CONTROL THAT RELOCATED THE FIX SITE. If the accumulate had been
# the defect — the reading `todo/t0841` was filed with — this cell would have
# been red too. It is green, so the wrong decision came from the liveness
# PRODUCER one layer up and the fix belongs there (Core #1: fix at the write
# site, not the read site).
#
# A regression here means the shared `walk_loop_two_pass` helper changed the
# statement arms' behaviour; those three arms are supposed to come out
# byte-for-byte equivalent.

String mk(String a, String b):
    return a + b

void main():
    String s = mk("a", "b")
    Vector[String] parts = []
    for i in 0..3:
        parts.push(s)
    print("".join(parts))
